        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>矩阵乘法笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #6b4a3a;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      to bottom,\n      #fdfdf7 0px,\n      #fdfdf7 27px,\n      #cfe0ea 28px\n    );\n    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n    padding: 15px 15px 30px 45px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .margin-line {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    left: 32px;\n    width: 1px;\n    background: #e0a0a0;\n  }\n  .header-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    gap: 30px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .header-row div { border-bottom: 1px solid #999; width: 90px; }\n  .topcross {\n    color: #333;\n    text-decoration: line-through;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .blue { color: #24359a; }\n  .red { color: #c0392b; }\n  .black { color: #222; }\n  .green { color: #2e6b3e; }\n  .section {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    margin-left: 15px;\n  }\n  .row-flex {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 15px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .side-note {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 12px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #24359a;\n    width: 130px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .rot {\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .vline-note {\n    position:absolute;\n    left: 5px;\n    top: 205px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color:#c0392b;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n  }\n  hr.plain {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid #ccc;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"margin-line\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"header-row\">\n    <div>No.</div>\n    <div>Date</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"topcross\">: 注册商标学生 [illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"vline-note\">笔记录</div>\n\n  <!-- Example: A and B matrices -->\n  <div class=\"section blue row-flex\">\n    <span>例：设 A =</span>\n    <span>$\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0 & \\rightarrow & 2 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & -1 & 4\\end{pmatrix}$</span>\n    <span style=\"margin-left:30px;\">B =</span>\n    <span>$\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}$</span>\n    <span class=\"green\" style=\"margin-left:15px;\">求AB</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section blue indent row-flex\">\n    <span>AB =</span>\n    <span>$\\begin{pmatrix}-5 & 6 & 7 \\\\ 10 & 2 & -6 \\\\ -2 & 17 & 10\\end{pmatrix}$</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section black indent\" style=\"font-size:13px;\">\n    ( 1×0 + 0×1 + (-1)×2   ,   †2×(-1) )\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Section 2 -->\n  <div class=\"section red\" style=\"margin-top:18px; font-weight:bold;\">\n    2. 比秩\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section blue row-flex\">\n    <span>行列式：</span>\n    <span>$\\begin{vmatrix}a_{11} & a_{12} \\\\ a_{21} & a_{22}\\end{vmatrix} \\cdot \\begin{vmatrix}b_{11} & b_{12} & b_{13} \\\\ b_{21} & b_{22} & b_{23} \\\\ b_{31} & b_{32} & b_{33}\\end{vmatrix}$</span>\n    <span class=\"black\" style=\"margin-left:8px;\">有意义</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section blue row-flex\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n    <span>矩阵：</span>\n    <span>$\\begin{pmatrix}a_{11} & a_{12} \\\\ a_{21} & a_{22}\\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix}b_{11} & b_{12} & b_{13} \\\\ b_{21} & b_{22} & b_{23} \\\\ b_{31} & b_{32} & b_{33}\\end{pmatrix}$</span>\n    <span class=\"black\" style=\"margin-left:8px;\">无意义</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"black\" style=\"position:absolute; right:15px; top:236px; width:150px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.3;\">\n    △只有当第一个矩阵<br>的列数与第二个<br>矩阵的行数时，<br>两个矩阵才能相乘\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section blue\" style=\"margin-top:14px; font-weight:bold;\">\n    相乘结果矩阵形状：结果矩阵行数 = 第一个矩阵的行数\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"blue indent\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\">\n    列数 = 第二个矩阵的列数\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"black indent\" style=\"margin-top:6px; font-size:14px;\">\n    ( 中间相约，取两头：$A_{3\\times4}\\cdot B_{4\\times3} = C_{3\\times3}$ )\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section blue row-flex\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n    <span>例：</span>\n    <span>$\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 2 & 3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix}10\\end{pmatrix}$</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section blue\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\">\n    $\\begin{pmatrix}-2 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}\\begin{pmatrix}2 & 4 \\\\ -3 & -6\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2} = \\begin{pmatrix}-16 & -32 \\\\ 8 & 16\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}$\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section blue\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n    $\\begin{pmatrix}2 & 4 \\\\ -3 & -6\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}\\begin{pmatrix}-2 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2} = \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}$\n    <span class=\"black\" style=\"margin-left:25px; font-weight:bold;\">AB ≠ BA</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section black\" style=\"margin-top:18px;\">\n    ① 矩阵乘法不一定满足交换律\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section black\">\n    ② 矩阵 A ≠ 0, B ≠ 0 却有 AB = 0\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"black indent\">\n    从而不能由 AB = 0 得出 A = 0 或 B = 0 的结论\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section black\" style=\"margin-top:6px;\">\n    ③ AB = AC, A ≠ 0 不能推出 B = C\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</htm